Package: safeR
Title: Strict Type Checking for R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Charles", "Bates", , "charles.bates@earth.ox.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-8444-6322"))
Description: 
    The safeR package provides a set of tools for strict type checking in R. 
    It allows users to define custom classes and enforce type constraints on function inputs and outputs. Other utility functions are also provided.
